@startwbs
' WBS of the online shopping web site project, organised by product
' (deliverable-oriented, chapter 5 Figure 5-3 style).
' Level 1 = the project, level 2 = major deliverables, lower levels hang as
' vertical lists so that the chart fits an A4 portrait page.
' Shaded leaf nodes are the work packages (lowest level of the WBS).
' Layout trick: PlantUML always lays the children of the root out in a
' horizontal row, so an invisible boxless dummy root is added above the real
' level-1 node; 1.1-1.4 hang on the left of the trunk and 1.5-1.8 on the right.
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
<style>
wbsDiagram {
  node { Padding 5; Margin 3; RoundCorner 3; LineColor #4f81bd; BackgroundColor #ffffff; FontColor #111111; }
  arrow { LineColor #4f81bd; LineThickness 1.2; }
  leafNode { BackgroundColor #fff4d6; LineColor #c9a227; }
  :depth(0) { LineColor transparent; BackgroundColor transparent; FontColor transparent; arrow { LineColor transparent; } }
  :depth(1) { BackgroundColor #1a3e6e; LineColor #1a3e6e; FontColor #ffffff; FontStyle bold; FontSize 12; }
  :depth(2) { BackgroundColor #dce6f1; FontStyle bold; }
}
</style>
